# ==============================================================================
# PROGRAMACIÓN 2 - .GITIGNORE MULTIPROYECTO (PYTHON + DJANGO)
# Aplica en la raíz y en cualquier carpeta o subcarpeta anidada
# ==============================================================================

# --- Byte-compiled / cache / optimizados de Python ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/*.pyo

# --- Extensiones compiladas C / Cython ---
**/*.so
**/*.pyd
**/*.dylib

# --- Entornos virtuales y gestores de entornos ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/
**/.env/
**/ENV/
**/env.bak/
**/venv.bak/
**/conda-meta/
**/.conda/
**/.python-version
**/.pyenv/

# --- Empaquetado, distribución y builds ---
**/build/
**/develop-eggs/
**/dist/
**/downloads/
**/eggs/
**/.eggs/
**/lib/
**/lib64/
**/parts/
**/sdist/
**/var/
**/wheels/
**/share/python-wheels/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.installed.cfg
**/*.egg
**/MANIFEST

# --- Django: archivos estáticos, media, logs y base de datos local ---
**/staticfiles/
**/static_root/
**/media/
**/media_root/
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-journal
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm
**/db.sqlite3*
**/logs/
**/*.log

# --- Django: migraciones (descomenta si NO quieres ignorar migraciones) ---
# **/migrations/
# !**/migrations/__init__.py

# --- Testing, cobertura y linters / formateadores ---
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage.xml
**/*.cover
**/*.py,cover
**/.hypothesis/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.dmypy.json
**/dmypy.json
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.flake8
**/.behave/

# --- Jupyter Notebook / experimentos ---
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/*.ipynb

# --- IDEs y editores ---
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/settings.json
!**/.vscode/tasks.json
!**/.vscode/launch.json
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/*.sublime-project
**/*.sublime-workspace

# --- Archivos del sistema operativo ---
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini